  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Kip bag—a lightweight canvas mini tote—moves easily for days on the go, slipping comfortably across your body or into your hand. The zip-top closure keeps essentials in place, and an interior slip pocket offers organization for your phone and keys. Made in recycled nylon canvas, this crossbody bag feels as pretty as it does practical.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% Recycled Nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle Drop: 3.5&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap Drop: 24&quot; when fully extended</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior back slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip Closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 6.84&quot; (L) x 5.48&quot; (H) x 3.00&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
